"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3|\n"
"\n"
"This module creates a group in which only those in this group can edit\n"
"the sales price in a sale order.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Use Cases / Context\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"In some flows in certain companies, some employees cannot change the\n"
"selling price of a product in a sale order.\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"To configure this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to *Settings > Users & Companies > Users*.\n"
"2. In a user that you would like to be able to edit the sale price in\n"
"   sale order, in the **Access Rights** tab click on **Can Edit The\n"
"   Price in Sale**.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"To use this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to *Sales > Orders > Quotation*.\n"
"2. Within a sales order, only users who belong to the **Can Edit The\n"
"   Price in Sale** group can edit the **Unit Price** field.\n"
"\n"
